{"3618960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Tale Of Shadows: Fragments Part I", "steam_appid": 3618960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in darkness with no memory of who you are. In <i>A Tale of Shadows</i>, you must explore a haunting estate filled with forgotten secrets, eerie puzzles, and lurking horrors. Guided by a mysterious figure, you uncover lost memories and unravel a sinister mystery tied to a murder and a secret ancient ritual, and your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate through hidden rooms and strange objects, piece together clues, evade a shadowy creature, and uncover the truth behind a supernatural power that binds you to this place. Your choices shape the story, leading to multiple possible outcomes.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618960/extras/6c1ff2cb137ca7d0eb62b0681eb2ec06.poster.avif?t=1771441748\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618960/extras/6c1ff2cb137ca7d0eb62b0681eb2ec06.webm?t=1771441748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles to unlock your lost memories and piece together the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618960/extras/2e15f57e2272897cdab8cafc8e6d0384.poster.avif?t=1771441748\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618960/extras/2e15f57e2272897cdab8cafc8e6d0384.webm?t=1771441748\" type=\"v